OL,3,ARoll-out begins for passport-free
OL,4,Aairport e-gates
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers arriving into the UK will be
OL,7,Fable to pass through airport e-gates
OL,8,Fwithout showing their passport under a
OL,9,Fnew contactless system, the government
OL,10,Fhas announced.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, East Midlands Airport
OL,13,Fbecame the first airport to offer the
OL,14,Fnew technology before it is rolled out
OL,15,Fto all UK airports by early 2027, the
OL,16,FHome Office said.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
