OL,3,ARoll-out begins for passport-free
OL,4,Aairport e-gates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe system uses facial technology so as
OL,7,Fpassengers approach the e-gate, their
OL,8,Fphoto is taken and then checked against
OL,9,Fimmigration, travel and passport
OL,10,Finformation and, if verfied, the
OL,11,Fbarrier opens automatically.
OL,13,FTesting showed the new contactless
OL,14,Fsystem was up to 25% faster than using
OL,15,Fa passport, according to officials.
